              "machineNumber": "CT-L005-M15",
              "model": null,
              "orderInLine": 15,
              "name": "Wrapping Machine",
              "function": "This double-twist wrapping machine is built to wrap individual candies quickly, evenly and without waste. Its main purpose is to take loose candies, feed them one by one, and wrap each piece tightly using single or double paper, keeping the product clean and well protected. The machine aims to ensure crisp, neat wraps while reducing manual handling and keeping wrapping speeds high.",
